5
00:00:36,492 --> 00:00:45,050
Read questions carefully, choose best answer everyone!

6
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:55,069
What kind of person did king want to choose to inherit throne?

7
00:00:55,738 --> 00:00:59,672
You choose best answer!

8
00:01:00,353 --> 00:01:02,999
A

9
00:01:02,999 --> 00:01:06,660
A. King wanted to choose obedient person

10
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:08,749
A. King wanted to choose obedient, kind person

11
00:01:08,749 --> 00:01:11,319
A. King wanted to choose obedient, kind, hardworking person.

12
00:01:13,481 --> 00:01:14,952
B

13
00:01:14,952 --> 00:01:23,318
B. King wanted to choose honest and brave person.

14
00:01:26,723 --> 00:01:28,097
C

15
00:01:28,097 --> 00:01:36,835
C. King wanted to choose person who grew most rice.

16
00:01:48,129 --> 00:01:56,414
King wanted to choose honest and brave person.

17
00:02:03,699 --> 00:02:14,105
How did king find such person?

18
00:02:15,347 --> 00:02:17,231
A

19
00:02:17,231 --> 00:02:35,266
A. King gave each citizen a basket of boiled rice seeds to plant and set appointment:

20
00:02:35,266 --> 00:02:49,556
Whoever grows most rice will inherit throne, whoever has no rice seeds to submit will be punished.

21
00:02:51,035 --> 00:02:52,519
B

22
00:02:52,519 --> 00:03:06,096
B. King gave each citizen a basket of rice seeds and sees whoever carries most rice will be chosen.

23
00:03:13,940 --> 00:03:17,089
King did as follows:

24
00:03:17,089 --> 00:03:35,722
Ordered to give each citizen a basket of boiled rice seeds to plant and set appointment:

25
00:03:36,813 --> 00:03:51,717
Whoever grows most rice will inherit throne, whoever has no rice seeds to submit will be punished.

26
00:03:58,075 --> 00:04:06,623
Why did King choose little boy Chom?

27
00:04:06,945 --> 00:04:11,593
You choose best answer!

28
00:04:12,660 --> 00:04:14,740
A

29
00:04:15,740 --> 00:04:26,011
A. At harvest, Chom carried rice to capital to submit to king.

30
00:04:27,345 --> 00:04:28,478
B

31
00:04:28,478 --> 00:04:41,010
B. Chom dared to admit to king that seeds did not sprout although he took good care.

32
00:04:49,266 --> 00:05:06,467
King chose little boy Chom because he was honest, dared to admit to king that seeds did not sprout although he took good care.

33
00:05:15,858 --> 00:05:20,440
How did story end?

34
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:25,237
You choose best answer!

35
00:05:27,732 --> 00:05:29,253
A

36
00:05:29,253 --> 00:05:39,742
A. Chom was punished for not submitting rice.

37
00:05:41,300 --> 00:05:42,564
B

38
00:05:43,606 --> 00:05:55,104
B. Chom inherited throne and became a wise and good king.

39
00:05:56,947 --> 00:05:58,709
C

40
00:05:58,709 --> 00:06:09,514
C. Chom was rewarded by king with lots of gold, silver, treasures.

41
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:30,124
Chom inherited throne and became a wise and good king.

42
00:06:35,410 --> 00:06:40,959
In your opinion, why is an honest person worthy?

43
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:44,848
You choose best answer!

44
00:06:46,847 --> 00:06:47,945
A

45
00:06:47,945 --> 00:06:59,764
A. Honest person is worthy because they always tell truth.

46
00:07:00,623 --> 00:07:01,864
B

47
00:07:01,864 --> 00:07:15,804
B. Honest person likes to hear truth, dares to defend truth, defend good people.

48
00:07:16,516 --> 00:07:17,864
C

49
00:07:17,864 --> 00:07:23,130
C. Both A and B

50
00:07:32,872 --> 00:07:44,225
Honest person is worthy because they always tell truth.

51
00:07:45,210 --> 00:07:57,627
Honest person likes to hear truth, dares to defend truth and defend good people.

